#!/usr/bin/env bash
# holoklerosis_gate.sh -- ΟΛΟΚΛΗΡΩΣΙΣ, THE COMPLETION: the author's fifteen unifications as one development (page
# DOCS/III-HOLOKLEROSIS-THE-COMPLETION-PREREGISTRATION.md, e6c1349a9, strictly first), every instrument in III, POSIX shell or
# gawk -M, the Lean kernel bare.  One arm per LANDED stage, added only with its stage (law 16); every pin copied from a run; every
# tooth against a computation (law 24), bent in the build directory; the comment control; the tooth count pinned against a literal.
#   arm 9   THE 691 THREAD (Ο9): holoklerosis_691.sh reads five instruments' runs of record and re-derives every quotient exactly;
#           ten cells MET, the prime ONE across six readings, the shared composed organs NAMED (law 6 measured).
#   arm 1   THE FIBRE'S EXACT POLE (Ο1): fibre_pole.awk's Laurent determinant at every rational cell; z^2 + 6z + 1 divides at Kperp = 0
#           (MF Theorem 3.1 by exact division), the law cosh kappa = 3 + 2 n_pi + m^2 on all eight cells, the geometry KAT.
#   arm 3   THE WEYL MOLIEN SERIES (Ο3): |W(B4)| = 384, |W(D4)| = 192, |W(F4)| = 1152 by closure, the series equal to the degree
#           products to degree 24, the first anisotropic degrees 4, 4, 6; the dropped-generator control refused by its order 48.
#   arm 4   THE SECTOR FREE ENERGIES (Ο4): ΣΤΡΟΦΙΓΞ's 72 nontrivial sector cells all below one, 12 columns decreasing in L, Q8 below Z2
#           at all 36 matched cells, S3 refused by name.
#   arm 5   MG2's THRESHOLD RE-DECIDED (Ο5): the universal bound's row sum in exact directed rounding at 15 groups, PASS at beta* and
#           FAIL at beta* + 1e-4 on every one.
#   arm 6   THE CERTIFICATE DOOR (Ο6): INERTIA and DOMINANCE exact; ΘΕΤΙΚΟΝ's 160 and -400 as signatures; the planted cases; a
#           non-symmetric input and a non-dominant pair refused by name.
#   arm 12  THE WEIL METER (Ο12): ΘΕΤΙΚΟΝ's curve ON-CIRCLE at six rungs with its S_3, S_4 re-derived (28, -28), the control OFF-CIRCLE
#           at rung 1, K4 and Petersen RAMANUJAN, the prism C_20 x K_2 OUTSIDE at rung 5, the archimedean rung READ.
#   arm 7   THE KERNEL'S READING (Ο7): the Lean artifact re-emitted beside the committed copy and equal to it byte for byte, thirteen
#           theorems by `decide` alone accepted by the bare kernel, the forged mass numerator refused.
#   arm 8   THE STATE TABLE (Ο8): eighteen rows of the Clay chain rendered from a pinned source, every pin found in its record, none
#           absent; the bent-pin control (one pin bent) refused by name -- STALE with absent=1.
#   arm 10  THE RANK-ONE PAN (Ο10): the sixteen sign -1 classes of level <= 100 matched to their models by a_p at the good primes and
#           each given a rational point of infinite order (mP != O for m <= 12) by exact search; 37a's (0,0), 65a's torsion passed over.
#   arm 11  THE WEIGHT-FOUR FORM THROUGH ΠΟΛΥΩΙΔΗ (Ο11): the cells (6,4) and (12,4), the symbols twice the forms, a_p(12.4.a.a) separated
#           exactly from the traces at p = 5..23 and CONCORD with ΣΤΗΡΙΓΜΟΣ' point counts at all seven; the L-value door NAMED owed.
#   arm 13  THE FLOW'S VALUATIONS (Ο13): ΓΕΦΥΡΩΣΙΣ' 2-adic column 2, 6, 14, 30 and the odd-prime columns handed to ΔΙΑΓΝΩΜΩΝ (DEEP, no
#           direction gone); Addendum IV's two laws met at every recorded step (2^(s-1) at 5, Jacobsthal at 3, step 14 included).
#   arm 14  THE COMPLETIONS BY FIELD (Ο14): ΣΥΜΠΑΝ's §2.34 stands with its thirty rows (its census is ΣΥΜΠΑΝ's own gate, arm 6).
#   arm 15  THE DECIDER'S SECOND ROAD AND THE ALPHABETS (Ο15): T1 and T2 re-decided in exact rationals on the author's records (PASS, PASS,
#           the reading UNVALIDATED by its own rule), the twelve surfaces' alphabets registered, one within-surface collision named.
#   arm 16  THE SIEGEL THREAD (Ο9', the author's refinement): the Bernoulli numbers derived, Kummer's index factored, every prime of the
#           weights 12..22 a wall of ΜΕΣΟΤΟΙΧΟΝ at (1,k), one congruent eigenvalue of ΠΕΛΩΡ's digraph (three at 691) and a factor of the
#           Siegel mass; weight 24 past the mass; the planted 101 refused.
#   arm 17  ADDENDUM I, S-A1 REFUTED: the staked coarse-cosine quadratic divides at W = 1 (the corners) and at no interior evaluation point.
#   arm 18  ADDENDUM I, S-A2, THE BAND'S FIBRE RATE AT FIVE MOMENTA: the 32 x 32 real representation, a perfect square at every cell, the
#           corners reproducing Ο1, the interior poles pinned as regression guards, monotone in K_1 -- the minimum at Kperp = 0.
